{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find, take, process an object: if close, take; if visible, move and take; if not, scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Sequence>     <Action ID = MoveToObject    />     <Action ID = TakeObject    /> </Sequence> <Action ID = ScanForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveInRandomDirection    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
